ESPAsyncWebServer 3.12.1: preserve send credit while a producer has no data.

RESPONSE_TRY_AGAIN may leave no bytes queued for transmission. Debiting a
credit then stalls both chunked and large fixed-length responses: later
polls cannot refill the buffer, and there is no outstanding data to ACK.
Only debit actual writes, including partial header writes, and account for
short body writes before leaving the send loop.

